        "B": "144",
        "C": "36",
        "D": "108"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "(2x+3y)² = 4x² + 9y² + 12xy. 144 = 4x² + 9y² + 72.",
      "hash": "e59e99acc517f280",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि 2x + 3y = 12 और xy = 6 है, तो 4x² + 9y² का मान क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "72",
            "B": "144",
            "C": "36",
            "D": "108"
          },
          "explanation": "(2x+3y)² = 4x² + 9y² + 12xy. 144 = 4x² + 9y² + 72. 4x² + 9y² = 72."
        }
      }
    },
